   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "For the ratio test, \\( \\left|\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}\\right| = \\frac{n \\left|{x + 4}\\right|^{2}}{8 \\left(n + 1\\right)} \\).",
